{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/jouri-hills-arada-properties-jumeirah-golf-estates","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":724,"crm_id":"144","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Jouri Hills","slug":"jouri-hills-arada-properties-jumeirah-golf-estates","display_address":"Jumeirah Golf Estates","building_type":["apartment","villa","mansions","townhouse"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Arada Properties","price":5158000,"display_price":"5.158M","lattitude":25.0181126,"longitude":55.1814884,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Jouri Hills - a collection of luxury residences located in the luxury gated community of Jumeirah Golf Estates. The development offers <strong>3-4 bedroom townhouses, five-bedroom villas, and six-bedroom mansions.</strong> The design is contemporary in style. The houses have spacious rooms. Each residence has a private garden, a terrace and a garage for 2 cars. Panoramic windows provide the houses with natural light, which creates an atmosphere of cosiness and harmony.</p><p>The complex adheres to the concept of eco-friendly, green plants are woven into the facades of the houses, and thanks to eco-friendly materials, environmental damage is minimised. Jouri Hills has modern amenities such as swimming pool, gymnasium, sports fields and children's play areas. The residences are located in the middle of a green park with many walking paths as well as recreational areas. Kindergartens, schools and medical centres are located nearby.</p><p>A major motorway, Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, passes close to Jouri Hills, allowing residents to quickly reach key locations in Dubai. The famous Dubai Butterfly Garden and Dubai Miracle Garden parks, Global Village theme park, Palm Jumeirah, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are all within a 20-minute drive. Dubai Airport is a 35-minute drive away.</p><p>Jouri Hills is a community designed for living with children, providing opportunities for a prosperous family life. The complex is also an excellent investment opportunity, capable of generating a stable income of up to 6% per annum.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/144/images/2023/6/13/gKgWKPcUBQRnZ5Cx9BAVXEKFhgvLDlvFw4gTh3BA.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/13/gKgWKPcUBQRnZ5Cx9BAVXEKFhgvLDlvFw4gTh3BA.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/144/images/2023/6/13/kqgI7kNwIYY6XuYTSFQAMl1OewqcIDcHPlFIApH6.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/13/kqgI7kNwIYY6XuYTSFQAMl1OewqcIDcHPlFIApH6.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/144/images/2023/6/13/yTSGpj0ZaMRpKtBthtHkoHlPLDVerbCs48ffJKDh.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/13/yTSGpj0ZaMRpKtBthtHkoHlPLDVerbCs48ffJKDh.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1559,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_514bd67c44.pdf","hash":"Brochure_514bd67c44","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":827,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2393,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Townhouse","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2394,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Townhouse","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2395,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 B